## 🔧 Build Commands

**From module directory** (`modules/<module_name>/`):
```bash
make clean && make          # Build module
make test                   # Run all tests (if GHDL legacy)
```

**CocotB testing** (from `tests/`):
```bash
make TEST_MODULE=clk_divider_core    # Run specific test
make list-tests                      # List available tests
make clean                           # Clean artifacts
```

**GHDL**: Always use `--std=08` flag

